words.txt is an adaptation: entries were filtered to Han-only headwords of 2-6
characters whose reading differs from the per-character default, and the
numbered pinyin was converted to tone marks. As an adaptation of a ShareAlike
work, it must be distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0 with attribution.

